    "body": "[Suggested](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/pull/1943#issuecomment-5902032203) by @theStack: add a new check on silent payments vector tests: if N outputs are found, ensure they all have distinct x-only pubkeys.\r\n\r\nThis catches the mutant from #1943 (`j_start + i / 2` -> `(j_start + i) / 2` in `secp256k1_silentpayments_check_label_batch`), which maps several matches to the same tx output and previously went undetected.",
